1
00:00:00,876 --> 00:00:03,002
( phone ringing )

2
00:00:03,002 --> 00:00:04,171
HELLO.

3
00:00:04,171 --> 00:00:05,339
HEY, JOEY.

4
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:06,465
Hey, Pheebs.

5
00:00:06,465 --> 00:00:08,091
LISTEN, CAN YOU DO ME A FAVOR?

6
00:00:08,091 --> 00:00:10,302
I FORGOT THE PIN NUMBER
TO MY ATM CARD.

7
00:00:10,302 --> 00:00:11,595
CAN YOU GET IT FOR ME?

8
00:00:11,595 --> 00:00:13,305
Sure. Where is it?

9
00:00:13,305 --> 00:00:15,975
I SCRATCHED IT ON THE ATM
MACHINE DOWN ON THE CORNER.

10
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:18,894
OH, SO YOU'RE 5639?

11
00:00:18,894 --> 00:00:20,813
THAT'S IT. THANKS, PHEEBS.

12
00:00:20,813 --> 00:00:22,147
HEY.

13
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:23,565
OH, DO YOU WANT
TO TALK TO CHANDLER?

14
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:25,317
IS THAT JOEY?
LET ME TALK TO HIM.

15
00:00:25,317 --> 00:00:27,026
No, 'cause he didn't
believe in my movie

16
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:31,448
WHICH IS A BIG MISTAKE,
BECAUSE IT IS REAL. REAL.

17
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:33,826
I'VE BEEN TRYING TO APOLOGIZE
TO HIM ALL WEEK.

18
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:35,661
IF HE'S NOT GOING TO LET ME
DO IT ON THE PHONE

19
00:00:35,661 --> 00:00:37,454
I'M GOING DOWN THERE,
I'M GOING TO DO IT IN PERSON.

20
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:39,665
PHEEBS, I HEARD THAT.
CAN YOU PUT HIM ON?

21
00:00:39,665 --> 00:00:40,624
YEAH.

22
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:43,293
HEY.

23
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:46,505
DON'T COME OUT HERE.

24
00:00:46,505 --> 00:00:48,465
NO, NO, NO, NO.
I SUPPORT YOU 100%

25
00:00:48,465 --> 00:00:50,009
AND I WANT TO PROVE THAT
TO YOU IN PERSON.

26
00:00:50,009 --> 00:00:51,552
I GOT THAT. I FORGIVE YOU.

27
00:00:51,552 --> 00:00:53,470
DON'T COME OUT HERE.

28
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,806
YOU HAVEN'T BEEN TAKING MY CALLS
FOR A WEEK.

29
00:00:55,806 --> 00:00:57,599
I'M TOTALLY OVER IT, CHANDLER.

30
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:59,768
FRIENDS FOREVER.
DON'T COME OUT HERE.

31
00:01:01,061 --> 00:01:04,398
WOULD YOU MIND
DOING A PICTURE WITH US?

32
00:01:04,398 --> 00:01:05,440
WHAT WAS THAT?

33
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,484
UH, ENTERTAINMENT TONIGHT.

34
00:01:07,484 --> 00:01:09,403
Yeah. Okay, so...

35
00:01:09,403 --> 00:01:11,071
GOOD TALKING TO YOU,
AND DON'T COME OUT HERE.

36
00:01:11,071 --> 00:01:12,031
ALL RIGHT.

37
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:14,449
OKAY.

38
00:01:21,248 --> 00:01:26,003
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

39
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:28,005
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

40
00:01:28,005 --> 00:01:30,966
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

41
00:01:30,966 --> 00:01:35,554
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

42
00:01:35,554 --> 00:01:38,097
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN
YOUR DAY, YOUR WEEK ♪

43
00:01:38,097 --> 00:01:40,642
♪ YOUR MONTH,
OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

44
00:01:40,642 --> 00:01:44,521
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

45
00:01:44,521 --> 00:01:48,567
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

46
00:01:53,072 --> 00:01:54,573
MONICA?

47
00:01:54,573 --> 00:01:56,408
I'M SORRY I'M LATE.

48
00:02:00,037 --> 00:02:01,496
MONICA?

49
00:02:02,581 --> 00:02:04,458
PHOEBE?

50
00:02:04,458 --> 00:02:07,377
OH, PHOEBE I'M SO SORRY.
HAVE YOU BEEN HERE LONG?

51
00:02:07,377 --> 00:02:10,255
THAT'S OKAY.

52
00:02:10,255 --> 00:02:13,300
WHAT THE HELL
TOOK YOU SO LONG?

53
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:15,803
OKAY, YOU CANNOT
TELL CHANDLER, OKAY?

54
00:02:15,803 --> 00:02:16,971
BUT I RAN INTO RICHARD.

55
00:02:16,971 --> 00:02:18,472
WHICH RICHARD?
THE RICHARD.

56
00:02:18,472 --> 00:02:22,183
RICHARD SIMMONS?
OH, MY GOD.

57
00:02:22,183 --> 00:02:24,352
NO. MY EX-BOYFRIEND, RICHARD.

58
00:02:24,352 --> 00:02:26,605
YOU KNOW, THE TALL GUY,
MUSTACHE?

59
00:02:26,605 --> 00:02:28,941
OH, OKAY. THAT ACTUALLY
MAKES MORE SENSE.

60
00:02:28,941 --> 00:02:30,150
SO HOW WAS IT?

61
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:32,193
IT WAS REALLY NICE.
WE STARTED TALKING

62
00:02:32,193 --> 00:02:34,947
AND THEN I-I ENDED UP
HAVING LUNCH WITH HIM.

63
00:02:34,947 --> 00:02:36,281
THAT IS SO WEIRD.
I HAD A DREAM

64
00:02:36,281 --> 00:02:37,532
THAT YOU HAD LUNCH
WITH RICHARD.

65
00:02:37,532 --> 00:02:40,661
REALLY?
BUT AGAIN, RICHARD SIMMONS.

66
00:02:40,661 --> 00:02:42,496
GO ON.
THE STRANGE PART WAS,

67
00:02:42,496 --> 00:02:44,957
HE WAS REALLY NICE
AND HE LOOKS GREAT

68
00:02:44,957 --> 00:02:47,292
BUT I DIDN'T FEEL
ANYTHING AT ALL.

69
00:02:47,292 --> 00:02:49,252
OOH. SO NOW, WHY CAN'T
WE TELL CHANDLER?

70
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:51,379
BECAUSE IT'LL
TOTALLY FREAK HIM OUT.

71
00:02:51,379 --> 00:02:53,465
TOMORROW'S OUR ANNIVERSARY.
I JUST DON'T WANT
ANYTHING TO SPOIL THAT.

72
00:02:53,465 --> 00:02:57,385
OH. I CAN'T BELIEVE YOU GUYS
HAVE LASTED A WHOLE YEAR.

73
00:02:57,385 --> 00:03:01,348
WOW, I OWE RACHEL
20 BUCKS.

74
00:03:01,348 --> 00:03:04,059
WHAT?
ON A TOTALLY
DIFFERENT BET.

75
00:03:06,269 --> 00:03:07,521
HEY.

76
00:03:07,521 --> 00:03:08,856
IT'S ALMOST OUR ANNIVERSARY.

77
00:03:08,856 --> 00:03:10,065
I KNOW.

78
00:03:10,065 --> 00:03:11,650
CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?
ONE YEAR AGO TODAY

79
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:13,360
I WAS JUST YOUR
ANNOYING FRIEND, CHANDLER.

80
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:17,781
AW... NOW YOU'RE JUST
MY ANNOYING FRIEND, CHANDLER.

81
00:03:17,781 --> 00:03:19,407
HUH.
I GOT YOU A PRESENT.

82
00:03:19,407 --> 00:03:20,784
OH, BUT IT'S
NOT TILL TOMORROW.

83
00:03:20,784 --> 00:03:22,786
I KNOW, BUT YOU HAVE
TO OPEN IT TODAY.

84
00:03:22,786 --> 00:03:23,787
OKAY.

85
00:03:23,787 --> 00:03:25,080
( both tittering )

86
00:03:30,794 --> 00:03:32,587
( tittering )

87
00:03:36,341 --> 00:03:38,886
OKAY! THERE YOU GO!

88
00:03:38,886 --> 00:03:40,846
IT'S TWO TICKETS TO VEGAS!

89
00:03:40,846 --> 00:03:43,431
WOW!
YEAH, FOR THIS WEEKEND!

90
00:03:43,431 --> 00:03:45,559
OH, GOSH, IT'LL BE PERFECT.
YOU GET TO SEE JOEY.

91
00:03:45,559 --> 00:03:47,728
PLUS, WE GET TO START
OUR ANNIVERSARY CELEBRATION

92
00:03:47,728 --> 00:03:49,063
ON THE PLANE.

93
00:03:49,063 --> 00:03:52,149
WE CAN CALL IT
OUR "PLANE-IVERSARY."

94
00:03:53,525 --> 00:03:55,694
DO WE HAVE TO?

95
00:03:55,694 --> 00:03:57,696
NO.
OKAY, BUT THIS IS GREAT,

96
00:03:57,696 --> 00:03:59,656
BUT JOEY SAID HE DIDN'T WANT
ANY OF US OUT THERE.

97
00:03:59,656 --> 00:04:01,909
OH, HE JUST DOESN'T WANT US
TO GO THROUGH ANY TROUBLE.

98
00:04:01,909 --> 00:04:03,118
THINK HOW EXCITED
HE'S GOING TO BE

99
00:04:03,118 --> 00:04:04,619
WHEN WE GO
AND SURPRISE HIM.

100
00:04:04,619 --> 00:04:06,872
PLUS, WE GET TO HAVE
OUR OWN...

101
00:04:06,872 --> 00:04:08,623
"ANNI-VEGAS-RY."

102
00:04:10,584 --> 00:04:14,171
"AN-NEVADA-VERSARY"!

103
00:04:14,171 --> 00:04:16,882
YEAH, I THINK WE SHOULD
SEE OTHER PEOPLE.

104
00:04:16,882 --> 00:04:18,383
BUT WE CAN GO, RIGHT?
YES.

105
00:04:18,383 --> 00:04:19,885
OKAY.
IT'S A GREAT IDEA.

106
00:04:19,885 --> 00:04:21,260
OKAY, I'M GOING
TO GO, TOO.

107
00:04:24,139 --> 00:04:26,683
YOU KNOW, PHEEBS, IT'S
KIND OF OUR ANNIVERSARY.

108
00:04:26,683 --> 00:04:29,686
PLEASE. YOU ARE NOT
GOING TO DITCH ME AGAIN
LIKE YOU DID WITH LONDON.

109
00:04:29,686 --> 00:04:31,688
DITCH YOU? PHOEBE,
YOU WERE PREGNANT WITH...

110
00:04:31,688 --> 00:04:33,398
UH-HUH, GREAT STORY.
I'M GOING.

111
00:04:36,317 --> 00:04:38,195
HI.
Phoebe: HEY.

112
00:04:38,195 --> 00:04:39,738
HEY, YOU GUYS, LISTEN.

113
00:04:39,738 --> 00:04:41,656
THIS WEEKEND WE'RE ALL
GOING TO GO TO LAS VEGAS

114
00:04:41,656 --> 00:04:44,492
TO SURPRISE JOEY--

115
00:04:44,492 --> 00:04:46,327
INCLUDING ME!

116
00:04:46,327 --> 00:04:47,871
DO YOU WANT TO GO?

117
00:04:47,871 --> 00:04:50,082
WELL, I GUESS I COULD TAKE
A COUPLE DAYS OFF WORK.

118
00:04:50,082 --> 00:04:52,209
OF COURSE YOU COULD TAKE
A COUPLE DAYS OFF WORK

119
00:04:52,209 --> 00:04:55,796
BECAUSE THIS TRIP INCLUDES ME!

120
00:04:55,796 --> 00:04:57,131
OH, NO. WAIT A MINUTE.

121
00:04:57,131 --> 00:04:58,423
WAIT. I'VE GOT
A PRESENTATION TOMORROW.

122
00:04:58,423 --> 00:04:59,841
I CAN'T MISS THAT.

123
00:04:59,841 --> 00:05:02,094
OH, I'VE GOT TICKETS
TO THE VAN GOGH EXHIBIT.

124
00:05:02,094 --> 00:05:04,179
I'VE BEEN WAITING, LIKE,
A YEAR FOR THIS.

125
00:05:04,179 --> 00:05:07,182
SO, RACH, WHY DON'T YOU AND I
FLY OUT TOGETHER SATURDAY?

126
00:05:07,182 --> 00:05:08,225
THAT SOUNDS GREAT.

127
00:05:08,225 --> 00:05:09,308
I'LL CALL THE AIRLINES.

128
00:05:09,308 --> 00:05:10,602
OKAY. YEAH.

129
00:05:10,602 --> 00:05:11,937
THAT'LL BE NICE, ACTUALLY

130
00:05:11,937 --> 00:05:13,688
TO HAVE THE APARTMENT
TO MYSELF FOR A NIGHT.

131
00:05:13,688 --> 00:05:15,816
OH, YEAH, SO YOU CAN
WALK AROUND NAKED.

132
00:05:18,235 --> 00:05:20,195
NO. SO I CAN BE BY MYSELF.

133
00:05:20,195 --> 00:05:21,822
YOU KNOW,
HAVE A LITTLE ALONE TIME.

134
00:05:21,822 --> 00:05:24,449
YEAH, NAKED ALONE TIME.

135
00:05:24,449 --> 00:05:26,409
NO, PHOEBE. JUST BECAUSE
I'M ALONE DOESN'T MEAN

136
00:05:26,409 --> 00:05:28,162
I WANT TO WALK
AROUND NAKED.

137
00:05:28,162 --> 00:05:30,789
I MEAN, YOU LIVE ALONE.
YOU DON'T WALK AROUND NAKED.

138
00:05:30,789 --> 00:05:33,834
UH-HUH. WHY DO YOU THINK
IT TAKES ME SO LONG
TO ANSWER THE DOOR?

139
00:05:40,423 --> 00:05:43,510
SO, SO FAR, IS THIS TRIP
TO LAS VEGAS BETTER OR WORSE

140
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:45,344
THAN THE TRIP TO LONDON?

141
00:05:45,344 --> 00:05:48,598
SO FAR, IT'S PRETTY MUCH
THE SAME, PHEEBS.

142
00:05:48,598 --> 00:05:51,310
OKAY. WHAT ABOUT AFTER
I GIVE YOU THESE CANDIES?

143
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:54,562
YEAH, I GUESS IT'S
A LITTLE BETTER NOW.

144
00:05:54,562 --> 00:05:55,772
HA-HA.

145
00:05:55,772 --> 00:05:58,025
OKAY, LAS VEGAS-- ONE;

146
00:05:58,025 --> 00:06:00,902
LONDON-- ZERO.

147
00:06:00,902 --> 00:06:02,570
I'LL BE RIGHT BACK. OOH.

148
00:06:05,364 --> 00:06:07,034
HAPPY "PLANE-IVERSARY."

149
00:06:07,034 --> 00:06:10,369
AW... I LOVE YOU.

150
00:06:10,369 --> 00:06:11,454
CAN I GIVE YOU
YOUR PRESENT NOW?

151
00:06:11,454 --> 00:06:12,914
OKAY.
OKAY.

152
00:06:17,836 --> 00:06:19,963
OH, MAN. DON'T
TELL ME I DID THIS.

153
00:06:19,963 --> 00:06:24,051
I LOVE "I FORGOT
THE PRESENT" FAKE OUT!

154
00:06:24,051 --> 00:06:26,469
HOW DO YOU FEEL ABOUT
THE "I REALLY DID
FORGET THE PRESENT

155
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:28,013
PLEASE FORGIVE ME"
NOT FAKE OUT?

156
00:06:28,013 --> 00:06:30,265
HONEY, THAT'S OKAY.
DON'T WORRY ABOUT IT.

157
00:06:30,265 --> 00:06:32,059
YOU CAN GIVE IT TO ME
WHEN WE GET BACK.
NO, THIS IS THE WORST THING

158
00:06:32,059 --> 00:06:33,727
THAT CAN HAPPEN ON
AN ANNIVERSARY EVER.

159
00:06:33,727 --> 00:06:35,436
OH, GOOD, ALL RIGHT.
YOU DECIDED TO TELL HIM

160
00:06:35,436 --> 00:06:36,771
ABOUT THE RICHARD THING.

161
00:06:40,608 --> 00:06:42,319
WHAT... WHAT
"RICHARD THING"?

162
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:44,487
OH, NO.

163
00:06:46,156 --> 00:06:47,199
WHAT "RICHARD THING"?

164
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:49,492
SIMMONS. GO WITH SIMMONS.

165
00:06:54,622 --> 00:06:58,126
OKAY. I, UM... I RAN
INTO RICHARD YESTERDAY

166
00:06:58,126 --> 00:07:02,297
AND HE ASKED ME IF I WANTED
TO GO FOR A BITE AND I DID.

167
00:07:02,297 --> 00:07:03,715
THE ONLY REASON WHY
I DIDN'T TELL YOU IS BECAUSE

168
00:07:03,715 --> 00:07:05,133
I-I KNEW YOU'D GET MAD

169
00:07:05,133 --> 00:07:08,220
AND I DIDN'T WANT
TO SPOIL OUR ANNIVERSARY.

170
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:09,470
I'M NOT MAD.

171
00:07:12,307 --> 00:07:14,059
REALLY?
OH, YEAH.

172
00:07:14,059 --> 00:07:15,560
YEAH, SO YOU BUMPED
INTO RICHARD.

173
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,354
YOU GRABBED A BITE.

174
00:07:19,522 --> 00:07:21,482
NO BIG DEAL.

175
00:07:24,152 --> 00:07:25,779
GREAT.

176
00:07:29,532 --> 00:07:31,450
OKAY, LONDON-- ONE.

177
00:07:38,208 --> 00:07:39,376
OOH!

178
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:53,848
HMM.

179
00:08:00,814 --> 00:08:02,690
( gasps )
OH, LOOK WHAT HAPPENED.

180
00:08:04,025 --> 00:08:07,154
HA, CHECK ME OUT.

181
00:08:07,154 --> 00:08:10,407
I'M IN MY KITCHEN... NAKED.

182
00:08:11,866 --> 00:08:15,329
I'M PICKING UP AN ORANGE.

183
00:08:15,329 --> 00:08:17,080
I'M NAKED.

184
00:08:19,166 --> 00:08:22,585
LIGHTING THE CANDLES NAKED

185
00:08:22,585 --> 00:08:24,296
AND CAREFULLY...

186
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,558
OH, MY GOD,
THAT'S RACHEL NAKED!

187
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,315
I CAN'T LOOK AT THAT.
I AM LOOKING AT THIS.

188
00:08:43,315 --> 00:08:46,567
OKAY, VIVID COLORS,
EXPRESSIVE BRUSH STROKES...

189
00:08:48,362 --> 00:08:53,074
UNLESS SHE WANTS ME
TO BE LOOKING AT THAT.

190
00:08:53,074 --> 00:08:54,909
SHE KNOWS I'M HOME.

191
00:08:54,909 --> 00:08:58,079
SHE KNOWS I CAN SEE HER.

192
00:08:58,079 --> 00:09:01,916
WHAT KIND OF GAME
IS SHE PLAYING?

193
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:06,421
I THINK MAYBE
SOMEONE'S LONELY TONIGHT.

194
00:09:06,421 --> 00:09:09,757
( chuckling ):
OH, DR. GELLER, STOP IT.

195
00:09:09,757 --> 00:09:11,009
YOU'RE BEING SILLY.

196
00:09:11,009 --> 00:09:13,428
( chuckles )

197
00:09:13,428 --> 00:09:15,013
OR AM I?

198
00:09:16,431 --> 00:09:20,060
♪ I... love to love you, baby ♪

199
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,560
OW!

200
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,314
♪ I... love to love you, baby ♪

201
00:09:24,314 --> 00:09:26,316
OW.
( knock on door )

202
00:09:26,316 --> 00:09:31,154
♪ I... love to love you, baby ♪

203
00:09:31,154 --> 00:09:32,572
( music stops )

204
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:34,574
♪ MMM...
LOVE TO LOVE YOU, BABY ♪

205
00:09:34,574 --> 00:09:37,035
OW. DARN IT.

206
00:09:41,498 --> 00:09:42,541
( groans )

207
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,629
HEY.

208
00:09:53,927 --> 00:09:56,137
MAY I COME IN?

209
00:09:56,137 --> 00:09:58,806
UH, YEAH, IF YOU WANT TO.

210
00:09:58,806 --> 00:10:02,561
DO YOU WANT ME TO?

211
00:10:02,561 --> 00:10:03,728
YEAH, SURE?

212
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:04,938
SO DO I.

213
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:14,030
OKAY, RACH, BEFORE
ANYTHING HAPPENS

214
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:16,824
I JUST WANT TO LAY DOWN
A COUPLE OF GROUND RULES.

215
00:10:16,824 --> 00:10:19,911
THIS IS JUST ABOUT TONIGHT.

216
00:10:19,911 --> 00:10:21,329
I DON'T WANT
TO GO THROUGH WITH THIS

217
00:10:21,329 --> 00:10:25,292
IF IT'S GOING TO RAISE
THE QUESTION OF "US."

218
00:10:25,292 --> 00:10:27,710
OKAY? I JUST WANT
THIS TO BE...

219
00:10:27,710 --> 00:10:30,547
( shoe thumps )

220
00:10:30,547 --> 00:10:32,549
ABOUT WHAT IT IS.

221
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:38,388
AND, UM...
( clearing throat )

222
00:10:38,388 --> 00:10:40,307
W-WHAT IS THAT, ROSS?

223
00:10:40,307 --> 00:10:44,478
THE PHYSICAL ACT OF LOVE.

224
00:10:44,478 --> 00:10:46,104
WHAT? ARE YOU CRAZY?

225
00:10:46,104 --> 00:10:49,483
OH, SO-SO YOU WEREN'T TRYING
TO ENTICE ME JUST NOW

226
00:10:49,483 --> 00:10:50,858
WITH YOUR, YOUR NAKEDNESS?

227
00:10:50,858 --> 00:10:53,903
( gasps )

228
00:10:53,903 --> 00:10:55,238
OH... GOD.

229
00:10:55,238 --> 00:10:58,074
YOU SAW ME?

230
00:10:58,074 --> 00:11:00,118
OH...

231
00:11:00,118 --> 00:11:03,913
YOU WEREN'T TRYING TO ENTICE ME
WITH YOUR NAKEDNESS.

232
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:05,665
NO, NO.

233
00:11:05,665 --> 00:11:07,334
YOU THOUGHT...
YOU ACTUALLY THOUGHT

234
00:11:07,334 --> 00:11:09,669
I WANTED TO HAVE SEX WITH YOU?

235
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:10,629
OH, MY...

236
00:11:13,672 --> 00:11:15,300
NO.

237
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:19,720
NO... NO.

238
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:24,142
NO, NO, NO, NO.

239
00:11:30,649 --> 00:11:33,860
♪ MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY ♪

240
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:35,612
♪ MONEY ♪

241
00:11:35,612 --> 00:11:38,948
♪ MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY ♪

242
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,325
♪ MONEY ♪

243
00:11:40,325 --> 00:11:43,244
♪ MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY ♪

244
00:11:43,244 --> 00:11:44,703
♪ MONEY ♪

245
00:11:44,703 --> 00:11:46,914
♪ MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY ♪

246
00:11:46,914 --> 00:11:48,625
HEY, YOU GUYS... WAIT.

247
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:52,546
YOU GUYS, THIS PLACE IS SO MUCH
BETTER THAN LONDON, OKAY?

248
00:11:52,546 --> 00:11:54,005
THIS LADY DRESSED
LIKE CLEOPATRA

249
00:11:54,005 --> 00:11:55,298
GAVE ME THIS COUPON--

250
00:11:55,298 --> 00:11:57,967
99-CENT STEAK
AND LOBSTER DINNER. HUH.

251
00:11:57,967 --> 00:11:59,802
PHOEBE, YOU DON'T
EAT ANIMALS.

252
00:11:59,802 --> 00:12:03,056
FOR 99 CENTS,
I'D EAT YOU.

253
00:12:03,056 --> 00:12:05,684
OKAY. I COULD TOTALLY
SETTLE DOWN HERE.

254
00:12:05,684 --> 00:12:08,102
IT'S GOT EVERYTHING
I COULD EVER WANT.

255
00:12:08,102 --> 00:12:10,438
INCLUDING JOEY. LOOK!

256
00:12:10,438 --> 00:12:12,315
OH, LOOK. HI!

257
00:12:12,315 --> 00:12:13,816
OH, MY GOD.

258
00:12:13,816 --> 00:12:16,695
HEY, JOEY!

259
00:12:16,695 --> 00:12:18,863
HEY! HEY!

260
00:12:18,863 --> 00:12:20,699
WOW.
HI.

261
00:12:20,699 --> 00:12:23,742
LOVE YOUR CONDOMS, MY MAN.

262
00:12:23,742 --> 00:12:24,952
W-WHAT ARE YOU GUYS
DOING HERE?

263
00:12:24,952 --> 00:12:26,287
I-I THOUGHT I TOLD YOU
NOT TO COME.

264
00:12:26,287 --> 00:12:28,456
WHY ARE YOU DRESSED
AS A GLADIATOR?

265
00:12:28,456 --> 00:12:29,916
UH... BECAUSE...

266
00:12:29,916 --> 00:12:31,334
I'M SHOOTING
A SCENE RIGHT NOW.

267
00:12:31,334 --> 00:12:34,128
YEAH, I, UH...
I PLAY A GLADIATOR.

268
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:35,754
UH, YOU KNOW WHAT?
HOLD ON A SECOND.

269
00:12:35,754 --> 00:12:37,549
CAN WE CUT?!

270
00:12:37,549 --> 00:12:38,925
YEAH, MY-MY FRIENDS ARE HERE.

271
00:12:38,925 --> 00:12:40,218
I'M GOING TO TAKE
A LITTLE BREAK.

272
00:12:40,218 --> 00:12:42,011
WHO-WHO ARE YOU
TALKING TO?

273
00:12:42,011 --> 00:12:43,012
THE, UH...

274
00:12:43,012 --> 00:12:44,763
DIRECTOR.

275
00:12:44,763 --> 00:12:46,224
UH... HER.

276
00:12:49,768 --> 00:12:51,605
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.
IT'S NOT A GLADIATOR MOVIE.

277
00:12:51,605 --> 00:12:52,855
I WORK HERE.

278
00:12:52,855 --> 00:12:54,566
WHY? WHAT HAPPENED?

279
00:12:54,566 --> 00:12:55,734
WELL, THE MOVIE
GOT SHUT DOWN

280
00:12:55,734 --> 00:12:57,318
BECAUSE THEY RAN
OUT OF MONEY

281
00:12:57,318 --> 00:12:59,279
SO I'M WORKING HERE
TILL IT STARTS UP AGAIN

282
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,363
IF IT EVER DOES.

283
00:13:00,363 --> 00:13:02,490
OH, SUCH A DRAG.

284
00:13:02,490 --> 00:13:04,783
LOOK, I'M SORRY
I DIDN'T TELL YOU.
I'M SORRY, MAN.

285
00:13:04,783 --> 00:13:06,578
NO, NO, IT'S OKAY.
APPARENTLY THERE'S
A NEW POLICY

286
00:13:06,578 --> 00:13:08,162
WHERE WE DON'T HAVE TO SHARE
EVERYTHING WITH EVERYBODY.

287
00:13:08,162 --> 00:13:09,623
I KNEW YOU WERE NOT
OKAY WITH THAT.

288
00:13:09,623 --> 00:13:12,626
SO YOU'RE A GLADIATOR?

289
00:13:12,626 --> 00:13:14,210
YEAH, WHAT'S
GOING ON?

290
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:16,504
MONICA HAD
LUNCH WITH RICHARD.

291
00:13:16,504 --> 00:13:18,423
DAWSON?

292
00:13:18,423 --> 00:13:19,674
Phoebe:
NO...

293
00:13:19,674 --> 00:13:22,343
BUT THAT WOULD
HAVE BEEN SO COOL.

294
00:13:22,343 --> 00:13:24,137
NO, HER BOYFRIEND, RICHARD.

295
00:13:24,137 --> 00:13:26,389
IT MEANT NOTHING, OKAY?

296
00:13:26,389 --> 00:13:28,767
AFTER ALL THIS TIME,
HOW CAN YOU NOT TRUST ME?

297
00:13:28,767 --> 00:13:30,977
WHEN YOU GO LUNCHING
WITH HUNKY MUSTACHE MEN

298
00:13:30,977 --> 00:13:32,353
AND DON'T TELL ME ABOUT IT.

299
00:13:34,522 --> 00:13:38,025
YOU'RE RIGHT. I'M SORRY,
I SHOULD HAVE TOLD YOU.

300
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:39,778
THANKS.

301
00:13:39,778 --> 00:13:40,945
AW, THERE WE GO.

302
00:13:40,945 --> 00:13:42,572
I LOVE VEGAS.

303
00:13:43,615 --> 00:13:44,991
I PROMISE YOU,
NEXT TIME

304
00:13:44,991 --> 00:13:46,576
I ABSOLUTELY
WILL TELL YOU.

305
00:13:50,330 --> 00:13:51,331
NEXT TIME?

306
00:13:51,331 --> 00:13:54,041
OOH, SO CLOSE.

307
00:13:54,041 --> 00:13:55,752
THERE'S NOT GOING
TO BE A NEXT TIME.

308
00:13:55,752 --> 00:13:57,337
YOU CANNOT SEE HIM
EVER AGAIN.

309
00:13:57,337 --> 00:13:58,797
I CANNOT SEE HIM?

310
00:13:58,797 --> 00:14:01,174
I MEAN, YOU CAN'T
TELL ME WHAT TO DO.

311
00:14:01,174 --> 00:14:04,427
OH, THAT'S SO FUNNY,
BECAUSE I THINK I JUST DID.

312
00:14:04,427 --> 00:14:05,970
IF YOU'RE GOING TO BE
ACTING LIKE THIS ALL NIGHT

313
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:07,180
I DON'T EVEN WANT
TO BE AROUND YOU.

314
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,056
FINE WITH ME.
FINE. HAPPY ANNIVERSARY.

315
00:14:09,056 --> 00:14:10,266
WHOA, GUYS, GUYS, PLEASE.

316
00:14:10,266 --> 00:14:11,850
COME ON, THIS IS OBVIOUSLY

317
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:14,145
JUST A BIG
MISUNDERSTANDING.

318
00:14:14,145 --> 00:14:15,730
NO, IT IS NOT.
WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

319
00:14:15,730 --> 00:14:17,023
HEY, HEY!
DON'T LOOK AT ME.

320
00:14:17,023 --> 00:14:18,566
I JUST WORK HERE.

321
00:14:22,487 --> 00:14:23,863
OKAY, UM... ROSS?

322
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:25,406
I'M A LITTLE WARM

323
00:14:25,406 --> 00:14:27,158
SO I'M GOING TO BE
TAKING OFF MY SWEATER.

324
00:14:27,158 --> 00:14:29,868
NOW, I'M, I'M JUST
LETTING YOU KNOW

325
00:14:29,868 --> 00:14:32,079
THIS IS NOT 
AN INVITATION

326
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:34,207
TO THE PHYSICAL
ACT OF LOVE.

327
00:14:35,667 --> 00:14:38,919
YEP, THAT'S HILARIOUS.

328
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:41,047
I'M SORRY,
I'M DONE. I'M DONE.

329
00:14:41,047 --> 00:14:42,549
YOU KNOW, LAST NIGHT

330
00:14:42,549 --> 00:14:44,801
WAS EMBARRASSING
FOR YOU, TOO.

331
00:14:44,801 --> 00:14:46,845
NO, NOT REALLY.

332
00:14:46,845 --> 00:14:49,764
I JUST DON'T
EMBARRASS THAT EASILY.

333
00:14:49,764 --> 00:14:51,808
WHAT? YOU TOTALLY
GET EMBARRASSED.

334
00:14:51,808 --> 00:14:54,602
NO, I DON'T.
ROSS, I THINK I'M JUST

335
00:14:54,602 --> 00:14:56,563
A MORE SECURE PERSON
THAN YOU ARE.

336
00:14:56,563 --> 00:14:57,605
IS THAT SO?

337
00:14:57,605 --> 00:14:58,565
YEAH.

338
00:15:00,066 --> 00:15:01,568
HEY, LADY!

339
00:15:01,568 --> 00:15:04,278
I DON'T CARE
HOW MUCH YOU WANT IT, OKAY?!

340
00:15:04,278 --> 00:15:06,030
I AM NOT GOING
TO HAVE SEX WITH YOU

341
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,240
IN THE BATHROOM!

342
00:15:12,537 --> 00:15:14,247
HEY, YOU KNOW,
IN ROMAN TIMES

343
00:15:14,247 --> 00:15:16,915
THIS WAS MORE
THAN JUST A HAT.

344
00:15:16,915 --> 00:15:17,916
REALLY?

345
00:15:17,916 --> 00:15:19,460
YEAH, SURE, SURE.

346
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:21,920
THEY WOULD SCRUB
THE FLOORS WITH IT.

347
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:24,424
THEY WOULD USE IT TO GET
THE MUD OFF THEIR SHOE

348
00:15:24,424 --> 00:15:27,385
AND SOMETIMES, UNDERNEATH
THE HORSE WOULD GET DIRTY

349
00:15:27,385 --> 00:15:28,969
SO THEY WOULD STICK IT...
JOEY!

350
00:15:30,012 --> 00:15:31,806
I CANNOT BELIEVE THIS IS HOW

351
00:15:31,806 --> 00:15:33,266
I'M SPENDING MY ANNIVERSARY.

352
00:15:33,266 --> 00:15:34,809
ALL RIGHT, I'LL TAKE
YOU SOMEPLACE NICE THEN.

353
00:15:34,809 --> 00:15:36,811
LOOK. A GUY TIPPED ME
100 BUCKS TODAY.

354
00:15:36,811 --> 00:15:38,062
WHOA.
YEAH, YEAH.

355
00:15:38,062 --> 00:15:39,980
HE WAS PLAYING BLACKJACK
FOR LIKE AN HOUR

356
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:41,816
AND HE WON $5,000.

357
00:15:41,816 --> 00:15:43,484
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT? $5,000.

358
00:15:43,484 --> 00:15:45,944
YOU KNOW, IF I WON $5,000,
I'D JOIN A GYM.

359
00:15:45,944 --> 00:15:47,739
YOU KNOW,
BUILD UP MY UPPER BODY

360
00:15:47,739 --> 00:15:51,284
AND HIT RICHARD
FROM BEHIND WITH A STICK.

361
00:15:51,284 --> 00:15:54,454
WAIT A MINUTE.
WHY DON'T I JUST DO
WHAT THAT GUY DID?

362
00:15:54,454 --> 00:15:56,997
I'LL TAKE THIS $100,
TURN IT INTO $5,000

363
00:15:56,997 --> 00:15:58,917
AND THEN I'LL TURN THAT
INTO ENOUGH MONEY

364
00:15:58,917 --> 00:16:01,127
TO GET MY MOVIE
GOING AGAIN.

365
00:16:01,127 --> 00:16:02,754
GOOD LUCK.

366
00:16:02,754 --> 00:16:04,213
CHANDLER,
I DON'T NEED LUCK.

367
00:16:04,213 --> 00:16:05,214
I HAVE THOUGHT THIS THROUGH.

368
00:16:05,214 --> 00:16:06,173
I SEE.

369
00:16:11,512 --> 00:16:13,431
THANK YOU.
THANKS.

370
00:16:13,431 --> 00:16:14,724
I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.

371
00:16:14,724 --> 00:16:17,184
THIS IS LIKE THE
WORST NIGHT EVER.

372
00:16:17,184 --> 00:16:19,270
YOU KNOW, MONICA,
YOU HAD A MINOR SETBACK

373
00:16:19,270 --> 00:16:21,021
IN YOUR RELATIONSHIP
WITH CHANDLER.

374
00:16:21,021 --> 00:16:22,774
BIG DEAL.
IT'S ONLY CHANDLER.

375
00:16:24,442 --> 00:16:26,945
I AM SO SORRY.

376
00:16:29,322 --> 00:16:32,450
THIS IS CRAZY.
I MEAN, IT WAS SUCH
A STUPID ARGUMENT.

377
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:34,034
I DIDN'T EVEN WANT
TO SEE RICHARD AGAIN.

378
00:16:34,034 --> 00:16:37,705
SO GO FIX IT.
GO FIND CHANDLER.

379
00:16:37,705 --> 00:16:39,499
HE'S PROBABLY UP
IN YOUR ROOM.

380
00:16:39,499 --> 00:16:41,793
TELL HIM THAT YOU'RE SORRY
AND THAT YOU LOVE HIM.

381
00:16:41,793 --> 00:16:43,085
YOU'RE RIGHT, PHOEBE.

382
00:16:43,085 --> 00:16:44,629
YOU'RE RIGHT.
THANK YOU.

383
00:16:44,629 --> 00:16:46,589
SURE.

384
00:16:46,589 --> 00:16:49,467
YEAH! LAS VEGAS--
NUMBER ONE!

385
00:16:59,101 --> 00:17:01,354
DID ANYBODY LOSE THIS?

386
00:17:01,354 --> 00:17:04,064
COMING OUT.
PLACE YOUR BETS.

387
00:17:04,064 --> 00:17:05,817
DICE ARE OUT.

388
00:17:08,235 --> 00:17:09,320
YO, 11.

389
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,404
PAY THE FRONT LINE.

390
00:17:14,742 --> 00:17:15,827
HMM.

391
00:17:19,330 --> 00:17:20,748
SO, UH...

392
00:17:20,748 --> 00:17:22,709
I'M ON MY WAY BACK
TO THE BATHROOM.

393
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:28,965
YEAH, ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT,
JUST KEEP WALKING, ALL RIGHT?

394
00:17:28,965 --> 00:17:31,759
( chortling )

395
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:40,476
ROSS, WHAT ARE YOU...?
I'M SORRY, SIR.

396
00:17:40,476 --> 00:17:43,688
I THINK HE JUST
REALLY LIKES YOU.

397
00:17:48,067 --> 00:17:49,610
HEY, YOU KNOW

398
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:53,155
THAT TEACHER WHO HAD
A BABY WITH HER STUDENT?

399
00:17:53,155 --> 00:17:56,075
( humming tune )

400
00:18:01,789 --> 00:18:04,250
WHAT THE?!
HI.

401
00:18:04,250 --> 00:18:06,085
MAY I HELP YOU?
YES, I'M SORRY.

402
00:18:06,085 --> 00:18:07,921
DO YOU HAVE ANY
EXTRA PANTS?

403
00:18:07,921 --> 00:18:10,882
MY FRIEND SEEMS TO HAVE
HAD A LITTLE "ACCIDENT."

404
00:18:16,846 --> 00:18:17,931
CAN I CHANGE $100?

405
00:18:17,931 --> 00:18:20,474
CHANGING $100.

406
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:21,475
GOOD LUCK, SIR.

407
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:22,727
THANKS.

408
00:18:24,144 --> 00:18:25,772
THAT'S RIGHT.

409
00:18:31,027 --> 00:18:32,612
THIRTEEN.

410
00:18:32,612 --> 00:18:34,405
HIT ME.

411
00:18:34,405 --> 00:18:36,156
OH, MAN!

412
00:18:39,285 --> 00:18:40,620
WAIT.

413
00:18:42,747 --> 00:18:44,832
CHANDLER, YOU ARE NOT
GOING TO BELIEVE THIS.

414
00:18:44,832 --> 00:18:47,668
I HAVE FOUND
MY IDENTICAL HAND TWIN.

415
00:18:51,714 --> 00:18:53,883
WHAT?

416
00:18:53,883 --> 00:18:57,261
MY IDENTICAL HAND TWIN.

417
00:18:57,261 --> 00:18:59,388
WHAT'S AN IDENTICAL
HAND TWIN?

418
00:18:59,388 --> 00:19:01,682
IT WAS INCREDIBLE.
CHANDLER, THE DEALER'S HANDS

419
00:19:01,682 --> 00:19:03,183
WERE EXACTLY LIKE MINE.

420
00:19:03,183 --> 00:19:05,770
IT WAS LIKE LOOKING
AT MY HANDS IN A MIRROR.

421
00:19:07,313 --> 00:19:08,773
ARE YOU SURE
YOU WEREN'T

422
00:19:08,773 --> 00:19:11,149
LOOKING AT YOUR
HANDS IN A MIRROR?

423
00:19:11,149 --> 00:19:13,027
DON'T YOU SEE
WHAT THIS MEANS?

424
00:19:13,027 --> 00:19:15,362
I CAN FORGET ABOUT
THAT STUPID MOVIE.

425
00:19:15,362 --> 00:19:16,948
I'M GOING TO BE
A MILLIONAIRE!

426
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:21,535
HOW?

427
00:19:21,535 --> 00:19:22,996
LOOK, I DON'T HAVE IT
ALL WORKED OUT YET

428
00:19:22,996 --> 00:19:24,705
BUT IT'S GOT TO MEAN
BIG MONEY.

429
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:28,375
COME ON, IDENTICAL HANDS.

430
00:19:28,375 --> 00:19:30,044
AGAIN I MUST GO BACK TO...

431
00:19:30,044 --> 00:19:33,213
HOW?

432
00:19:33,213 --> 00:19:34,715
THIS IS VEGAS, MAN.

433
00:19:34,715 --> 00:19:37,093
PEOPLE WILL PAY TO SEE
FREAKY STUFF.

434
00:19:38,845 --> 00:19:41,764
HOW MUCH WOULD YOU PAY
TO SEE THIS HAND...

435
00:19:41,764 --> 00:19:43,182
TWICE?

436
00:19:43,182 --> 00:19:44,142
HUH?

437
00:19:47,269 --> 00:19:50,773
YOU KNOW, I CAN'T REALLY
PUT A PRICE ON THAT, JOE.

438
00:19:50,773 --> 00:19:52,984
HEY, ARE YOU UNSUPPORTING
ME AGAIN?

439
00:19:52,984 --> 00:19:55,987
NO, NO.
I SUPPORT YOU 100%.

440
00:19:55,987 --> 00:19:58,405
I JUST DIDN'T... I DIDN'T
GET IT RIGHT AWAY.

441
00:19:58,405 --> 00:20:00,158
NOW I'M CAUGHT UP.

442
00:20:00,158 --> 00:20:02,076
IDENTICAL HAND TWINS.

443
00:20:02,076 --> 00:20:03,744
IT'S A MILLION-DOLLAR IDEA.

444
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:05,079
RIGHT?

445
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:06,873
( knocking )

446
00:20:09,249 --> 00:20:10,501
HEY.
PHEEBS...

447
00:20:10,501 --> 00:20:12,545
YEAH?
I FOUND MY IDENTICAL
HAND TWIN!

448
00:20:12,545 --> 00:20:14,672
OH, YOU'RE SO LUCKY.

449
00:20:17,466 --> 00:20:19,552
HEY.

450
00:20:19,552 --> 00:20:21,012
SO, WHERE'S MONICA?

451
00:20:21,012 --> 00:20:22,680
DID YOU GUYS MAKE UP?

452
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,681
NO.

453
00:20:23,681 --> 00:20:25,808
BUT SHE JUST
CAME UP HERE.

454
00:20:25,808 --> 00:20:27,935
THAT WAS JOEY.

455
00:20:27,935 --> 00:20:29,645
I WONDER WHERE SHE IS.
THAT'S SO WEIRD.

456
00:20:29,645 --> 00:20:32,439
YEAH, WELL, SHE'S PROBABLY
TALKING TO RICHARD.

457
00:20:32,439 --> 00:20:34,817
WOULD YOU STOP THAT?

458
00:20:34,817 --> 00:20:36,360
YOU WANT TO KNOW
THE FIRST THING SHE SAID

459
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:38,278
WHEN SHE CAME BACK FROM
HER LUNCH WITH RICHARD?

460
00:20:38,278 --> 00:20:40,031
SHE DIDN'T FEEL
ANYTHING FOR HIM.

461
00:20:40,031 --> 00:20:42,575
SHE LOVES YOU.

462
00:20:42,575 --> 00:20:44,284
REALLY?
YES.

463
00:20:44,284 --> 00:20:46,245
SHE FEELS TERRIBLE.

464
00:20:46,245 --> 00:20:47,580
SHE REALLY WANTS TO MAKE UP.

465
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:50,666
YOU'VE GOT TO FIND HER.

466
00:20:50,666 --> 00:20:52,251
OKAY.

467
00:20:52,251 --> 00:20:53,293
GOOD.

468
00:21:00,218 --> 00:21:02,720
I SHOULD REALLY START
WEARING HATS.

469
00:21:11,854 --> 00:21:13,439
YAY!

470
00:21:13,439 --> 00:21:15,066
YES! YES!

471
00:21:15,066 --> 00:21:16,650
COME ON!

472
00:21:18,945 --> 00:21:20,738
WHERE ARE THE DICE?

473
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:51,936
WELCOME TO LAS VEGAS.

474
00:21:51,936 --> 00:21:53,187
DID YOU ENJOY...
YOUR FLIGHT?

475
00:21:53,187 --> 00:21:54,939
YES, I DID.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

476
00:21:54,939 --> 00:21:57,483
IT WAS EXCELLENT.

477
00:21:57,483 --> 00:21:58,776
HOPE YOU HAD
A NICE FLIGHT.

